NAME: ScrnSaver

DESCRIPTION:

Animated screen savers.

The control bar has < and > to
move between savers. X leaves
the app. The last saver is
remembered.

- Stars:  flight through a field
          of stars
- Aurora: northern lights over
          a lake
- Mandala: spinning geometric
          figures

The saver name is shown briefly
after each change. Tap ? for
this page.

NOTES:

To add a saver, create a C file
with one draw function and
register it in savers.c. The
comment at the top of savers.c
lists the steps.

Developed with AI assistance.
